cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite AMRFinderPlus
  (Feldgarden et al. 2021, doi:10.1038/s41598-021-91456-0) for the underlying
  determinant detection.
title: LACUNA-AMR
type: software
authors:
  - name: LACUNA-AMR project
identifiers:
  - description: "This is the project repository version 0.1.0 (pilot release)"
    type: other
    value: lacuna-amr-0.1.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://example.invalid/lacuna-amr"
abstract: >-
  License-clean, locally run toolkit that audits genome-based antimicrobial
  resistance predictions: label-quality auditing, clonal de-duplication,
  lineage/time/site-aware evaluation, calibrated probabilities and Mondorian
  split-conformal prediction sets. Research use only.
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - conformal prediction
  - evaluation
  - bioinformatics
